# Custom Subagent Routing

Use project subagents in `.cursor/agents` when tasks are non-trivial.

## Routing rules
- Use `flutter-explorer` before implementation when touching unfamiliar or multi-file areas.
- Use `flutter-implementer` for feature work, refactors, and bug fixes requiring edits.
- Use `flutter-test-runner` after substantive edits to run analyze/tests/codegen.
- Use `flutter-reviewer` before final handoff for regression/risk checks.

## Mandatory delegation thresholds

| Condition | Required agents (in order) |
|-----------|----------------------------|
| Unfamiliar feature folder | `flutter-explorer` |
| Edit touches file >300 lines | `flutter-explorer` before implement |
| Multi-file feature or refactor | `flutter-implementer` |
| Before handoff / PR | `flutter-reviewer` + `flutter-test-runner` |
| Drift schema or ARB changed | `flutter-test-runner` (include `build_runner`) |

## Delegation quality bar
- Delegate with explicit scope, expected output, and constraints.
- Prefer parallel delegation when tasks are independent.
- Keep final responses concise and file-path oriented.
